        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "【Quagmire】Placed on the ground (visible only to you); costs 25 coin per placement. After a trap is triggered, all players within a 3-block radius cannot move or use items for 6 seconds.",
            "zh_cn": "【泥沼】放在地面（仅自己可见），每次放置花费25金币。陷阱被踩中后，会使半径3格内的所有玩家6秒内无法移动和使用物品。",
            "zh_tw": "【泥沼】放在地面（僅自己可見），每次放置花費25金幣。陷阱被踩中後，會使半徑3格內的所有玩家6秒內無法移動和使用物品。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            1.8,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "【Ultimate · Net】Costs 130 coin to buy the Net Gun; it can be fired immediately (no initial cooldown), and enters a 150-second cooldown after each shot. Right-click to fire a net; on hitting a player or landing, it entangles players within a 5-block radius for 8 seconds.",
            "zh_cn": "【大招·捕网】可花费130金币购买捕网枪，每次发射后进入150秒冷却。右键发射捕网，命中玩家或落地后禁锢半径5格内玩家8秒。",
            "zh_tw": "【大招·捕網】可花費130金幣購買捕網槍，每次發射後進入150秒冷卻。右鍵發射捕網，命中玩家或落地後禁錮半徑5格內玩家8秒。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            2.08,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
